{
  "info": {
    "name": "Conavihsida Core API",
    "description": "Pruebas de Conavihsida.Core.Api para la demo, en el orden del flujo: login, seguridad por rol, expediente, consulta y receta, farmacia, auditoria y dashboard.\n\nAntes de usarla:\n1. Levanta la API desde Visual Studio y ajusta baseUrl si usa otro puerto.\n2. Pon en la variable apiKey el valor de CoreApi:ApiKey de Web.config (como valor actual, para que no se sincronice).\n3. Pon en clavePrueba la contraseña anotada en Database/Datos/usuarios_prueba.sql (tambien como valor actual).\n4. La base debe tener cargados los scripts de Database/Migraciones y Database/Datos.\n\nLos encabezados X-Usuario-Id y X-Roles simulan lo que agrega el Gateway despues de validar el JWT.\n\nPara correr todo: clic derecho en la coleccion, Run collection. Las carpetas 4 y 5 deben ir en orden.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-Api-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:58942"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "clavePrueba",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "origenWeb",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioMedico",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioAdmin",
      "value": "2"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioFarmacia",
      "value": "3"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioAuditor",
      "value": "4"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioCajero",
      "value": "5"
    },
    {
      "key": "pacienteId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "medicoId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "medicamentoId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "codigo",
      "value": "COD-TEST-0001"
    },
    {
      "key": "facturaId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "recetaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "citaId",
      "value": "0"
    },
    {
      "key": "fecha",
      "value": "2026-10-20"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login y roles (RF-CORE-01)",
      "description": "El CORE valida la contraseña y devuelve usuario y roles. El token JWT lo genera el Gateway. Requiere la variable clavePrueba.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login del cajero",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]); });",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve el rol Cajero', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().roles).to.include('Cajero'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"cajero.prueba\",\n  \"password\": \"{{clavePrueba}}\",\n  \"origen\": \"CAJA\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login con usuario inexistente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 401', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"no.existe\",\n  \"password\": \"x\",\n  \"origen\": \"WEB\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login con origen invalido",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 400', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"cajero.prueba\",\n  \"password\": \"x\",\n  \"origen\": \"OTRO\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Quien soy (encabezados del Gateway)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Usuario-Id",
                "value": "{{usuarioMedico}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Roles",
                "value": "Medico"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/yo"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Quien soy sin identidad",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 401', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/yo"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
